⍝ Migration step 1: inventory. What's in every component of every file?
⍝ Run:  dyalog sample-scripts/component-files/inventory.apls
⍝ Kinds decide the database design: tables → SQL tables, nested → JSON
⍝ columns. "JSON ok" says whether ⎕JSON can export it as is.
here←⊃1⎕NPARTS⊃2⎕NQ'.' 'GetCommandLineArgs'
dir←here,'data/'
Kind←{
    9=⎕NC⊂'⍵':'namespace'
    (0=10|⎕DR ⍵)∧1≥|≡⍵:'text'
    (11=⎕DR ⍵)∧1=|≡⍵:'boolean ',⍕⍴⍵
    1=|≡⍵:'numeric ',⍕⍴⍵
    'nested ',⍕⍴⍵
}
JsonOK←{0::'NO' ⋄ _←1(⎕JSON⍠'HighRank' 'Split')⍵ ⋄ 'yes'}
(names types)←0 1(⎕NINFO⍠1)dir,'*.dcf'
rows←⍬
:For f :In names[⍋names]
    t←f ⎕FTIE 0
    (first next)←2↑⎕FSIZE t
    :For n :In first+¯1+⍳next-first        ⍝ first, first+1, …, next-1
        v←⎕FREAD t n
        rows,←⊂(2⊃⎕NPARTS f)n(Kind v)(⊃⎕FRDCI t n)(JsonOK v)
    :EndFor
    ⎕FUNTIE t
:EndFor
⎕←↑(⊂'file' 'comp' 'kind' 'bytes' 'JSON ok'),rows
⎕←'' ⋄ ⎕←(⍕≢rows),' components in ',(⍕≢names),' files'
